  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_9075.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La ma&ntilde;ana de este domingo se ha llevado a cabo un anillamiento de aves en el Toll d&#39;Ascla de Onda, organizado por el Grup Au, el Club Desplome y el Ayuntamiento. Tambi&eacute;n se ha podido disfrutar del paraje y de las vistas al &#39;toll&#39;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/anellamentaustolldascla300314/img_9057.jpg\" alt=\"img_9057\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/anellamentaustolldascla300314/img_9058.jpg\" alt=\"img_9058\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/anellamentaustolldascla300314/img_9059.jpg\" alt=\"img_9059\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/anellamentaustolldascla300314/img_9060.jpg\" alt=\"img_9060\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/anellamentaustolldascla300314/img_9061.jpg\" alt=\"img_9061\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/anellamentaustolldascla300314/img_9064.jpg\" alt=\"img_9064\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/anellamentaustolldascla300314/img_9065.jpg\" alt=\"img_9065\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/anellamentaustolldascla300314/img_9066.jpg\" alt=\"img_9066\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/anellamentaustolldascla300314/img_9067.jpg\" alt=\"img_9067\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img